      "sourceText": "所谓静态坐标系相对关系是指两个坐标系之间的相对位置是固定不变的，比如：车辆上的雷达、摄像头等组件一般是固定式的，那么雷达坐标系相对于车辆底盘坐标系或摄像头坐标系相对于车辆底盘坐标系就是一种静态关系。",
      "translatedText": "The so\\-called static coordinate system relative relationship means that the relative position between two coordinate systems is fixed and unchanging\\. For example, components such as radar and cameras on a vehicle are generally fixed, so the radar coordinate system relative to the vehicle chassis coordinate system or the camera coordinate system relative to the vehicle chassis coordinate system is a static relationship\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
